Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted categories, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit strings.

Processing remains separate from argument parsing. Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with stderr output and no traceback.

